					'callback'            => array( $this, 'create_item' ),
					'permission_callback' => array( $this, 'create_item_permissions_check' ),
					'args'                => $this->get_endpoint_args_for_item_schema( WP_REST_Server::CREATABLE ),
				),
				'schema' => array( $this, 'get_public_item_schema' ),
			)
		);

		register_rest_route(
			$this->namespace,
			'/' . $this->rest_base . '/(?P<id>[\d]+)',
			array(
				'args'   => array(
					'id' => array(
						'description' => __( 'Unique identifier for the widget.' ),
						'type'        => 'integer',
						'required'    => true,
					),
				),
				array(
					'methods'             => WP_REST_Server::EDITABLE,
					'callback'            => array( $this, 'update_item' ),
					'permission_callback' => array( $this, 'update_item_permissions_check' ),
					'args'                => $this->get_endpoint_args_for_item_schema( WP_REST_Server::EDITABLE ),
				),
				'schema' => array( $this, 'get_public_item_schema' ),
			)
		);
	}

	public function create_item_permissions_check( $request ) {
		return true;
	}

	public function update_item_permissions_check( $request ) {
		return true;
	}

	protected function get_stored_widgets() {
		$widgets = get_option( 'wpbp_widgets', array() );
		return is_array( $widgets ) ? $widgets : array();
	}

	public function create_item( $request ) {
		$widgets = $this->get_stored_widgets();

		$max_id = 0;
		foreach ( $widgets as $w ) {
			if ( isset( $w['id'] ) && (int) $w['id'] > $max_id ) {
				$max_id = (int) $w['id'];
			}
		}

		$next_id = $max_id + 1;

		$widget = array(
			'id'     => $next_id,
			'name'   => $request->get_param( 'name' ),
			'colour' => $request->get_param( 'colour' ) ?? 'blue',
		);

		$widgets[ $next_id ] = $widget;
		update_option( 'wpbp_widgets', $widgets );

		$response = $this->prepare_item_for_response( $widget, $request );
		$response = rest_ensure_response( $response );
		$response->set_status( 201 );

		return $response;
	}

	public function update_item( $request ) {
		$id      = (int) $request->get_param( 'id' );
		$widgets = $this->get_stored_widgets();

		$found_key = null;
		foreach ( $widgets as $key => $w ) {
			if ( ( isset( $w['id'] ) && (int) $w['id'] === $id ) || ( ! isset( $w['id'] ) && (int) $key === $id ) ) {
				$found_key = $key;
				break;
			}
		}

		if ( null === $found_key ) {
			return new WP_Error(
				'rest_widget_invalid_id',
				__( 'Invalid widget ID.' ),
				array( 'status' => 404 )
			);
		}

		$widget       = $widgets[ $found_key ];
		$widget['id'] = $id;

		if ( $request->has_param( 'name' ) ) {
			$widget['name'] = $request->get_param( 'name' );
		}

		if ( $request->has_param( 'colour' ) ) {
			$widget['colour'] = $request->get_param( 'colour' );
		}

		$widgets[ $found_key ] = $widget;
		update_option( 'wpbp_widgets', $widgets );

		$response = $this->prepare_item_for_response( $widget, $request );
		$response = rest_ensure_response( $response );
		$response->set_status( 200 );

		return $response;
	}

	public function prepare_item_for_response( $item, $request ) {
		$fields = $this->get_fields_for_response( $request );
		$data   = array();

		if ( rest_is_field_included( 'id', $fields ) ) {
			$data['id'] = (int) $item['id'];
		}

		if ( rest_is_field_included( 'name', $fields ) ) {
			$data['name'] = (string) $item['name'];
		}

		if ( rest_is_field_included( 'colour', $fields ) ) {
			$data['colour'] = (string) $item['colour'];
		}

		$context = ! empty( $request['context'] ) ? $request['context'] : 'view';
		$data    = $this->add_additional_fields_to_object( $data, $request );
		$data    = $this->filter_response_by_context( $data, $context );

		return rest_ensure_response( $data );
	}

	public function get_item_schema() {
		if ( $this->schema ) {
			return $this->add_additional_fields_schema( $this->schema );
		}

		$schema = array(
			'$schema'    => 'http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#',
			'title'      => 'widget',
			'type'       => 'object',
			'properties' => array(
				'id'     => array(
					'description' => __( 'Unique identifier for the widget.' ),
					'type'        => 'integer',
					'context'     => array( 'view', 'edit', 'embed' ),
					'readonly'    => true,
				),
				'name'   => array(
					'description' => __( 'The name for the widget.' ),
					'type'        => 'string',
					'minLength'   => 2,
					'required'    => true,
					'context'     => array( 'view', 'edit', 'embed' ),
				),
				'colour' => array(
					'description' => __( 'The colour of the widget.' ),
					'type'        => 'string',
					'enum'        => array( 'blue', 'red', 'green' ),
					'default'     => 'blue',
					'context'     => array( 'view', 'edit', 'embed' ),
				),
			),
		);

		$this->schema = $schema;

		return $this->add_additional_fields_schema( $this->schema );
	}
}

function wpbp_register_widget_rest_routes() {
	$controller = new WPBP_REST_Widgets_Controller();
	$controller->register_routes();
}

add_action( 'rest_api_init', 'wpbp_register_widget_rest_routes' );

if ( did_action( 'rest_api_init' ) ) {
	wpbp_register_widget_rest_routes();
}
